    {
      "flavor_text": "やさしいひとの　そばに　いないと\nげんきが　でなくなってしまう。\nはねをうごかさずに　そらにうかべる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "상냥한 사람 곁에 있지 않으면\n기운이 나지 않게 되어버린다.\n날개를 움직이지 않고 뜰 수 있다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Il se démoralise vite s’il n’est pas avec des gens\nsympathiques. Il peut léviter sans battre des ailes.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Es wird entmutigt, wenn es unter unfreundlichen\nMenschen ist. Es kann ohne Flügel niedrig schweben.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Si no está con gente amable, se entristece. Puede\nflotar en el aire sin mover las alas.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "S’intristisce se non si trova con persone gentili.\nPuò restare sospeso in aria senza bisogno di\nmuovere le ali.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "It grows dispirited if it is not with kind people.\nIt can float in midair without moving its wings.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version": {
        "name": "x",
        "url": "/api/v2/version/23/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "優しい人の　そばに　いないと\n元気が　出なくなってしまう。\n羽を動かさずに　空に浮かべる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version": {
